title: Blockchain explorer used as a dead drop
severity: medium
score: 30
tags: web3, etherhiding, dead-drop
attack: T1102.001
description: A non-allowlisted page with no wallet UI reads a block-explorer API (Ethplorer,
  Blockchair, Etherscan...). EtherHiding variants use this to fetch their next stage from a
  transaction or token note.
---
// A page with no wallet UI and no wallet reads a blockchain explorer's API ...
requests
| where host in (list("web3.explorer_api_hosts"))
| where not(exists(wallet_ui)) and not(exists(wallet_requests))
// ... on a site that is not allowlisted.
| where not(exists(final_allowlisted))
| distinct host
